#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Lee's Wife
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "84_Lee's Wife"
msgid "Two million yen in one week!? That's impossible!"
msgstr "¡¿DOS millones de yenes en una semana?! ¡Eso es imposible!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Lee"
msgid "We just have to trust him... He'll be back to\\r\nreturn the money."
msgstr "Tendremos que confiar en él... El volverá para\\r\ndevolver el dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_Lee's Wife"
msgid "When, a million years from now!? His room was completely\\r\nempty! Your \"friend\" took you for everything you were worth!"
msgstr "¡¿Cuándo?! ¡Cuando los cerdos vuelen, más bien será!\\r\n¡Su habitación estaba totalmente vacía! ¡Tu \"amigo\"\\r\nsimplemente te usó para su conveniencia!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "120_Tanimura"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "¿Qué está pasando aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "144_Lee's Wife"
msgid "Listen to this! This good-for-nothing fool just\\r\nruined our whole lives!"
msgstr "¡Tiene que escuchar esto! ¡Este idiota, bueno para nada,\\r\nacaba de arruinar nuestras vidas!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "156_Lee's Wife"
msgid "They'll take our restaurant unless we get two million yen\\r\nby the end of the week!"
msgstr "¡Ellos tomarán nuestro restaurante a menos que consigamos\\r\ndos millones de yenes para el final de la semana!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "168_Tanimura"
msgid "I'm sorry, what? I don't get the full picture."
msgstr "Lo siento, ¿qué? No les comprendo ni la mitad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "180_Lee"
msgid "One of my friends needed some money. But he\\r\ndidn't have anything for collateral, so..."
msgstr "Uno de mis amigos necesitaba algo de dinero. Pero él\\r\nno tenía nada como garantía, así que..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "192_Lee's Wife"
msgid "That's no reason to put our restaurant on the chopping\\r\nblock! Really, how much of an idiot are you!?"
msgstr "¡Esa no es razón para poner nuestro restaurante en jaque!\\r\n¡¿En serio, que tan idiota eres?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Lee
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "204_Lee"
msgid "How could I say no to helping out a friend in need!?"
msgstr "¡¿Cómo podría decir que no a ayudar a un amigo en necesidad?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "216_Lee's Wife"
msgid "\"Help\"!? The only \"help\" you've done is help ruin our\\r\nbusiness and destroy our livelihood!"
msgstr "¡¿\"Ayuda\"?! ¡La única \"ayuda\" que has hecho es ayudar a\\r\narruinar nuestro negocio y destruir nuestro sustento!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "228_Lee's Wife"
msgid "Ohhh... Now what are we going to do...? We worked our hands\\r\nto the bone for years to get this place... and now we're\\r\ngoing to lose it over nothing..."
msgstr "Oh... ¿Y ahora qué vamos a hacer...? Nos quebrantamos las manos\\r\npor mucho tiempo para tener el lugar... Y ahora estamos\\r\npor perderlo por una estupidez..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Lee
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "240_Lee"
msgid "...I'm sorry."
msgstr "... Lo siento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "252_Tanimura"
msgid "So you got took for two million, huh? That's a lot of money.\\r\nI don't even think Zhao-san has that much tucked away..."
msgstr "Así que se te llevaron dos millones, ¿eh? Eso es mucho dinero.\\r\nNi siquiera creo que Zhao tenga tanto guardado..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Zhao
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
msgctxt "264_Zhao"
msgid "What's all this commotion?"
msgstr "¿A qué se debe todo este alboroto?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "276_Tanimura"
msgid "Oh, Zhao-san. Guess what happened to this guy..."
msgstr "Oh, Zhao-san. Adivina lo que le pasó a este tipo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "348_Zhao"
msgid "It's just as your wife says. There are limits to\\r\nwhat you can do for people."
msgstr "Es tal como dice tu esposa. Hay límites para\\r\nlo que puedes hacer por las personas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "360_Tanimura"
msgid "Can't you use some Asian Gateway funds?"
msgstr "¿No puedes usar algunos fondos del\\r\nHorizonte Asiático?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Zhao
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
msgctxt "372_Zhao"
msgid "No way! We don't have two million lying around."
msgstr "¡De ninguna manera! No tenemos dos millones\\r\ndando vueltas por ahí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Tanimura"
msgid "Yeah, I figured as much... The only other thing I can think\\r\nof is gambling... But two million's a dicey proposition."
msgstr "Sí, imaginé lo mismo... En la única otra cosa que puedo pensar\\r\nes el juego... Pero dos millones es una propuesta arriesgada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P26
#. y4:msg_speaker=Zhao
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
msgctxt "396_Zhao"
msgid "Don't tell me you're seriously considering this?"
msgstr "No me digas que estás considerando esto seriamente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "408_Tanimura"
msgid "I am. Now Zhao-san, do you know of any underground\\r\ncasinos? Somewhere with really high stakes?"
msgstr "Lo hago. Entonces, Zhao-san, ¿de casualidad conoces algún\\r\ncasino subterráneo? ¿Alguno que tenga apuestas altas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_Zhao"
msgid "This is Lee's doing, Ma-chan. You don't have to go\\r\nthat far out of your way to help him."
msgstr "Esto es asunto de Lee, Ma-chan. No tienes que ir\\r\ntan lejos para ayudarlo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "432_Tanimura"
msgid "Well, I couldn't help him even if I wanted to\\r\nwith my salary. But there's nothing wrong with\\r\nearning a quick buck at the tables, right?"
msgstr "Bueno, no podría ayudarlo aunque quisiera\\r\ncon mi salario. Pero no hay nada de malo en\\r\nganar dinero rápido en las mesas, ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=30
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P30
#. y4:msg_speaker=Zhao
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
msgctxt "444_Zhao"
msgid "If that's your decision, then I won't complain."
msgstr "Si esa es tu decisión, entonces no me quejaré."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "456_Zhao"
msgid "But I've been worried about you getting into gambling,\\r\nregardless of all the help you've given us. That's why\\r\nI haven't told you..."
msgstr "Pero he estado preocupado de que te metas en el juego,\\r\nA pesar de toda la ayuda que nos has dado.\\r\nEs por eso que no te lo he dicho..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=32
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P32
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "468_Tanimura"
msgid "Told me what?"
msgstr "¿Decirme qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "480_Zhao"
msgid "I hear there's an underground casino in Kamurocho.\\r\nPeople call it the Dragon Palace."
msgstr "Escuché que hay un casino subterráneo en Kamurocho.\\r\nLa gente lo llama el Palacio del Dragón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=34
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P34
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "492_Tanimura"
msgid "Really? Do you know where it is?"
msgstr "¿En serio? ¿Sabes dónde está?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=35
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P35
#. y4:msg_speaker=Zhao
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
msgctxt "504_Zhao"
msgid "Only that it's somewhere on <Color:255,200,200,255>Park Boulevard<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Solo que está en algún lugar del <Color:255,200,200,255>Bulevar del Parque<Color:Default>."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=36
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P36
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "516_Tanimura"
msgid "That's a start. I'll go look for it."
msgstr "Eso es un comienzo. Iré a buscarlo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=37
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P37
#. y4:msg_speaker=Lee
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "528_Lee"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Gracias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=38
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P38
#. y4:msg_speaker=Lee's Wife
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "540_Lee's Wife"
msgid "Yes, really, thank you."
msgstr "De verdad, gracias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=39
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P39
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "552_Tanimura"
msgid "Don't worry about it. Besides, we're talking about gambling here. There's a strong chance I'll lose, so don't get your hopes up yet."
msgstr "No te preocupes por eso. Además, aquí estamos hablando de\\r\njuegos de azar. Hay muchas posibildades de que pierda,\\r\nasí que no te hagas muchas ilusiones todavía."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=40
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P40
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "564_Tanimura"
msgid "And if I do manage to win, that'll just mean you have luck on your side, right?"
msgstr "Y si logro ganar, eso significará que tienes la suerte\\r\nde tu lado, ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=41
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P41
#. y4:msg_speaker=Lee
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "576_Lee"
msgid "Sir... You're wonderful!"
msgstr "Señor... ¡Eres maravilloso!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=42
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P42
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "588_Tanimura"
msgid "Well, I'll be back."
msgstr "Bueno, me iré por el momento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=44
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P44
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "612_Tanimura"
msgid "(So, the Dragon Palace is somewhere on Park Boulevard, huh? I should go have a look.)"
msgstr "(Entonces, el Palacio del Dragón está en algún lugar del\\r\nBulevar del Parque)."
